invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont64_blocks.c
catches: rsa_blocks_equiv_test
reason: a row of the square drops a_i times word k of its words, the top
  bit of 2a, so the result is short whenever the top bit of a's top word
  is set. bin/rsa_blocks_equiv_test squares operands whose top word has
  that bit, all ones under a modulus of all ones among them.

--- old
    uint64_t top_word = *a_word & blocks_mask_of_bit(*v_top);
--- new
    uint64_t top_word = *a_word & blocks_mask_of_bit(*v_top) & 0;
